#~ msgid "Connecting Zapier lets a Zap react to Notifuse events — a new contact, a list subscription, a segment a contact joined — and lets a Zap create or update contacts and subscribe them to your lists. Each Zap you turn on registers its own webhook subscription, which you can see in Settings → Webhooks."
